  {
   "id": "c29_9651",
   "type": "note",
   "x": 100,
   "y": 590,
   "rot": 0,
   "params": {
    "text": "The 555 is a one-shot: 1.1 x 47k x 100n = 5.2 ms high after each trigger, so the meter's average current follows the spark rate.",
    "size": "10"
   },
   "label": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "c30_7570",
   "type": "note",
   "x": 100,
   "y": 605,
   "rot": 0,
   "params": {
    "text": "G2 at 50 Hz is 1500 rpm on a four-cylinder four-stroke; RP1 set to 8k: about 0.26 mA, full scale (1 mA) near 190 Hz.",
    "size": "10"
   },
   "label": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "c31_5489",
   "type": "note",
   "x": 100,
   "y": 620,
   "rot": 0,
   "params": {
    "text": "Supply as on the site: 12 V through 15 ohm, a 9 V zener (9.1 V here) and 10 uF. The points and their clamp are drawn as G2, a clean 0-9 V",
    "size": "10"
   },
   "label": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "c32_3408",
   "type": "note",
